control: A tick hands its account over and records its latest authentication attempt when it ends
removes: a tick drops the write-back's and the recording's failures its unit of work ends with, so the tick's run reports neither
packages: ./worker/app
tests: TestAFailedWriteBackFailsTheJobKindsRun/delta_sync TestAFailedRecordingFailsTheJobKindsRun/delta_sync
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

